   {
    "title": "Board Game Timer",
    "description": "A web application to limit stop board game players from taking too long on their turns. I was inspired to make after playing a particularly long board game, and deciding that it could take a whole lot less time if there could be a way to make everyone play a little bit faster. As of now, it features:\n- A clean and elegant design\n- Support for a variable number of players\n- Player turn re-ordering\n- Locally storing settings data between sessions\n- Responsiveness to screen size; it'll look good on mobile or desktop\n- A pretty small sized bundle that loads quickly",
